*.pptx
*.DS_Store
*.tar.gz
.!*

# Interactive Plotly figures. Each embeds a full copy of plotly.js, so they run
# several MB apiece and dominate the repository size, while being fully
# regenerable from the committed CSVs via a demo's generate_plots.sh. They stay
# local; the PNG/PDF twins are what the READMEs display.
**/simulation_results/plots/*.html

